      opened one instead, and every fence in the following thirteen hundred
      lines has been inverted. Found by the rule-count guard rather than by
      reading: honouring fenced examples silently dropped one of the three
      claims, because it had ended up inside an example block nobody wrote. The
      guard now asserts that every document's fences close, so a reader that
      quietly checks less than it appears to says so.

