      no path from the message to --type ticket except guessing.
    - Five commands, not one: board.refs, board.show, column.list,
      column.sync and column.update all reach that refusal through one
      place, so fixing only the one it was reported on would have left four
      saying the same thing. A missing type now names the option and the
