    - TKT-183: bridge-unread. Every other rule asks whether the board is
      in order; this asks whether the answers are reaching anybody, which
      is the question that makes the rest worth anything.
    - It exists because of a measured failure on this project's own
      board. unpushed-work raised VIO-0005 at 17:58, escalated it to
