      before, so nothing changes underneath anybody. A column added
      tomorrow is still watched without being named anywhere.
    - And the columns consulted are the card's own. The rule read the
      ticket board's list whatever kind of card it was looking at, so an
      epic finishing somewhere the tickets do not was judged against the
