      use it" - and named 84 of 141. Fifty-seven were missing, including
      whole families: every attachment command, every checklist command,
      every column command, the collectors, board.show, board.refs,
      assign.list.
    - Not one of them was undocumented outright, which is exactly why
      nothing caught it. docs-match-code concatenates the manual, the
      reference and the policies guide and asks whether a command appears
      anywhere in that pile - the right question for "is it documented at
      all" and the wrong one for "can a reader of the reference find it".
    - mt5-ai reported one instance of it and withdrew the larger claim
      themselves; the surviving third was real and this is it. Their
