      export; export adds a board_hash. --if-changed HASH on show and
      export returns an unchanged marker with exit 1 when nothing
      differs, the payload with exit 0 otherwise, and exit 2 on a
      malformed hash; composes with projection and since (stricter
      wins); never writes.

0.37  2026-08-07
    - CA04 (EPIC-424): changed-since reads. show, list, and export take
