      envelope adds now for gap-free poll chaining. Future thresholds
      are empty with exit 0, malformed ones exit 2, unreadable stored
      stamps are never hidden, and show returns {} for an unchanged
      record.

0.36  2026-08-07
    - CA15 (EPIC-424): sparse reads. show, list, and export omit empty
      values by default (null, empty string, empty array, hash of only
      such values); --include-empty restores the fixed-key shape. false
      and 0 are never treated as empty; a field named in --fields stays
      visible even when empty; internal callers and the browser dialog
